WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.600
Should the client enter this market?

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:07.274
Use it when: A new country, customer segment or product category.

3
00:00:07.324 --> 00:00:11.563
Ask first: Why this market, and what would success look like, by when?

4
00:00:11.763 --> 00:00:17.156
Is the market attractive? Size and growth, typical margins and barriers to entry.

5
00:00:17.206 --> 00:00:22.003
Can we win? Competitors and their strength, what customers need and our edge.

6
00:00:22.053 --> 00:00:26.671
Will it pay? Revenue we can expect, running costs and upfront investment.

7
00:00:26.721 --> 00:00:31.378
Can we pull it off? Capabilities we lack, timing and pilot and key risks.

8
00:00:31.428 --> 00:00:40.623
The prize = market size × the share you can win × margin. Compare it with the upfront investment, then say how you would enter.
